- `PIXEL_T buf[64 * 64]` - fixed buffer (4096 elements)
- `palette[128]` - fixed palette size
- Loop bounds depend on `r.tl.y/r.br.y`, `r.tl.x/r.br.x`
- `palSize` derived from `mode & 127` where `mode = zis->readU8()`

